<view class="page capture-page">
  <view class="page-header"><view class="page-title">选择照片</view><view class="muted">单人照或双人合照都可以，请让每个人的正脸清晰可见。</view></view>
  <view class="steps"><view class="step current"><text class="step-number">01</text>选择照片</view><view class="step"><text class="step-number">02</text>设定时光</view><view class="step"><text class="step-number">03</text>遇见自己</view></view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">上传一张原照</view><text class="tag">私密创作</text></view>
    <view class="photo-guides"><text>正脸清晰</text><text>光线自然</text><text>单人或双人</text></view>
    <checkbox-group class="consent-panel" bindchange="consentChanged">
      <label class="row"><checkbox color="#26384a" value="accepted" checked="{{accepted}}" /><text>我确认照片中的人物已明确授权，用于本次带 AI 标识的年龄主题创作。</text></label>
    </checkbox-group>
    <view class="portrait-mat" wx:if="{{preview}}"><image class="preview" src="{{preview}}" mode="aspectFit" /><view class="photo-caption">这张原照会用于每个年龄的创作</view></view>
    <button class="upload-picker {{preview ? 'has-photo' : ''}}" disabled="{{!accepted || busy || choosing}}" bindtap="choose"><view class="upload-plus" wx:if="{{!preview}}">＋</view><view>{{choosing ? '正在检查照片' : preview ? '重新选择照片' : '选择一张照片'}}</view><view class="caption" wx:if="{{!preview}}">从相机或相册选择</view></button>
    <view class="caption upload-details" wx:if="{{details}}">{{details}}</view>
    <button class="button" wx:if="{{preview}}" disabled="{{!accepted || busy || choosing}}" bindtap="upload">{{busy ? '上传 ' + progress + '%' : '安全上传并继续'}}</button>
    <button class="button danger" wx:if="{{busy}}" bindtap="cancel">取消上传</button>
    <view class="status error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="privacy-foot">上传会话最多保留 24 小时。压缩重编码会移除非必要的位置与 EXIF 元数据，人物授权可随时撤回。</view>
</view>
